==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Fates|Dartrix|7}} from the {{TCG|Shining Fates}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Dartrix}}.
*'''Skill Dive''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Crobat|3}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

